<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Western Wireless raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Western Wireless raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown said it upgraded Western Wireless Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/4 to 14-1/4 in early morning exchange trade.</p>
